cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AutoMountBKP: an automatic backup when the backup disk is plugged in"
abstract: "Step-by-step notes for a Linux office server: an fstab entry, a udev rule, an rsync backup script and a systemd unit, so a labelled USB backup disk is mounted, receives a full backup of the shared folders and the Samba Active Directory backup, is synced, unmounted and powered off, with beeps and log lines at each stage."
authors:
